      "side": 1,
      "message": "The LED policy manager doesn\u0027t choose which color to apply. It just passes through the pattern with a time stamp. It\u0027s up to the individual LED driver to implement the transition.\n\nI made a mistake when updating the pwm driver of assuming that at most only 1 color would be skipped, but when I fix that problem everything should work correctly.",
